metallium-voxy-natives (part of the Metallium project, https://github.com/Crash09N/metallium)

This jar contains no code. It redistributes, unmodified, the macOS arm64 native libraries below, copied from the
official Maven Central artifacts, so that the Java classes Voxy already bundles can load them on Apple Silicon Macs:

- librocksdbjni-osx-arm64.jnilib
  from org.rocksdb:rocksdbjni:10.2.1 (RocksDB, https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb).
  RocksDB is dual-licensed under GPLv2 and the Apache License 2.0; it is redistributed here under the Apache License 2.0
  (RocksDB-LICENSE.Apache). RocksDB contains code from LevelDB under a BSD licence (RocksDB-LICENSE.leveldb).
  Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates; Copyright (c) 2011 The LevelDB Authors.

- macos/arm64/org/lwjgl/zstd/liblwjgl_zstd.dylib (+ META-INF/.../liblwjgl_zstd.dylib.sha1)
  from org.lwjgl:lwjgl-zstd:3.4.1:natives-macos-arm64 (LWJGL, https://www.lwjgl.org, BSD-3-Clause, LWJGL-LICENSE.md).
  The library statically contains Zstandard (https://github.com/facebook/zstd, BSD, zstd-LICENSE),
  Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.

- macos/arm64/org/lwjgl/lmdb/liblwjgl_lmdb.dylib (+ META-INF/.../liblwjgl_lmdb.dylib.sha1)
  from org.lwjgl:lwjgl-lmdb:3.4.1:natives-macos-arm64 (LWJGL, BSD-3-Clause, LWJGL-LICENSE.md).
  The library statically contains LMDB (https://www.symas.com/lmdb), OpenLDAP Public License 2.8 (LMDB-LICENSE),
  Copyright Howard Chu, Symas Corp. and the OpenLDAP Foundation.
